  "description": "All he wanted was to get wrecked by a hung, handsome octoman... San-Ho’s been pouring his deepest desires into octopus fishing (literally), so when he saves the Dragon King's octopus prince and lands and lands an invite to the palace, the first thing he asks for is his very own beastman husband. But instead of the massive, tentacled stud he imagined, he gets Baek-Kyung. No tentacles, no monster size... just a cute, compact little guy. He wanted calamari. He got shrimp. But hey… sometimes small packages pack a big punch.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
